@Flatserve_HostAddress = http://localhost:5220
@layerId = Forurensning_0000_Norge_3035_Skytefelt_GML.SkyteOg_vingsfelt

### All features
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/collection?userId=2&minX=4&minY=58&maxX=32&maxY=72&zoom=12
Accept: multipart/mixed

### Kristiansand centre (no features in the tracked dataset)
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/collection?userId=2&minX=7.95&minY=58.10&maxX=8.08&maxY=58.20&zoom=12
Accept: multipart/mixed

### Greater Kristiansand (no features in the tracked dataset)
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/collection?userId=2&minX=7.75&minY=58.0&maxX=8.30&maxY=58.35&zoom=12
Accept: multipart/mixed

### Oslo (no features in the tracked dataset)
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/collection?userId=2&minX=10.5&minY=59.8&maxX=10.95&maxY=60.05&zoom=12
Accept: multipart/mixed

### Single feature
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/{{layerId}}/feature/0
Accept: application/vnd.fgb

### Filter by in-use status
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/filter?value=brukes&attribute=status
Accept: multipart/mixed

### Filter by closed status
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/filter?value=nedlagt&attribute=status
Accept: multipart/mixed

### Auth Polygon
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/auth-polygon/2
Accept: application/geo+json

### Single layer (ordinary FGB response)
GET {{Flatserve_HostAddress}}/fgb/{{layerId}}/collection?userId=2&minX=4&minY=58&maxX=32&maxY=72&zoom=12
Accept: application/vnd.fgb
